{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "1stact_level_a001_04_end",
  "groupId": "1stact",
  "stageId": "a001_04",
  "title": "污点证人",
  "storyCode": "GT-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fdd750dc50f81f01ae504684ea219c89b446d3d5f56098a2d2fa23d142eea9ef",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这家伙是个瘸的！先解决掉他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "格拉尼！继续耗下去，我们全得交代在这儿了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "就算你这么说！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快！带着可萝尔走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我受了伤，会拖慢你们的速度！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "之后我会找办法和你们会合的！走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "说好了，记得要来拿你的那份！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "她们跑了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们的敌人是我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "......交战的声音似乎平息下来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "但是抱歉，可萝尔，现在我们没有休息的时间，还得快走才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没事......那个，鲍勃先生他，不知道怎么样了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "可能，要给他一些时间吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "给他些时间......？你是说——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "可萝尔！你没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "抱歉，被这个树根绊了一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "来，拉住我的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......谢谢你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "能走吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......没事的，只是擦伤。就像你说的，我们还是别停下脚步比较好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只要穿过森林就是莫拉蒂山的山脚下了，我们得进入半山腰第二个洞窟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "只能从洞口进去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是的，里面还有很多岔路和暗道，不过我知道该怎么走。宝藏就在洞窟的最深处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "嗯。这样的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咦？好、好可怕的声音......远处有什么爆炸了吗......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "仔细听，还有呐喊和惨叫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "是战斗的声音。还没结束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "......可萝尔，你害怕吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我很害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，为了让我的村子平静下来，让我们的土地重归安宁......我也有一定要去做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "是吗……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "你真坚强啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "没事。事不宜迟，我们继续前进吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
